# ============================================================================
# Pre-publication hardening (2026-08-03). The blocklist above is per-path and
# had gaps: the real-OSS campaign material and recent findings were untracked
# but NOT ignored, so a `git add -A` would have published them. Fail closed.
# ============================================================================

# Real-OSS campaign artifacts under the otherwise-public targets/ tree. The
# hygiene gate only catches root-level *-disclosure/, so anchor these by type
# (safe: tracked demo targets — canary/alsa/russcan/… — carry none of these).
/targets/*/JOURNAL.md
/targets/*/THREAT_MODEL.md
/targets/*/CONSOLIDATION.md
/targets/*/AB_COMPARISON.md
/targets/*/CVE-VARIANT-GROUNDTRUTH.md
/targets/*/BACKLOG-VERDICTS*.md
/targets/*/*-VERDICTS*.md
/targets/*/x509-lessons.md
/targets/*/disclosure/
/targets/*/hardening/
/targets/*/rustsec/
/targets/*/pr*-followup/
/targets/*/poc/
/targets/*/poc-*.rs
/targets/*/harness-*.txt
/targets/*/*.local.md
/targets/*/reply-draft*.md

